   "height": 30.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "改善点",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "改善点",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 14440,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 63898,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i2061",
   "x": 2398.999999999999,
   "y": 1252.0,
   "width": 450.19999999999993,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "1. OptionManager と各マネージャーが相互に引き合っている",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. OptionManager と各マネージャーが相互に引き合っている",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 14447,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 63929,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i2062",
   "x": 2398.999999999999,
   "y": 1272.0,
   "width": 526.2,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    WindowOption → MainEngine / AudioOption → AudioManager /\n    InputOption → InputManager。Option 側から押し込むのをやめ、\n    受け手が起動時と変更通知で読む形にすると片方向になる。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    WindowOption → MainEngine / AudioOption → AudioManager /\n    InputOption → InputManager。Option 側から押し込むのをやめ、\n    受け手が起動時と変更通知で読む形にすると片方向になる。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 14454,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 63960,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i2063",
   "x": 2398.999999999999,
   "y": 1352.0,
   "width": 401.0,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "2. 所有されている側が Instance() で親を引いている",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "2. 所有されている側が Instance() で親を引いている",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 14461,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 63991,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i2064",
   "x": 2398.999999999999,
   "y": 1372.0,
   "width": 618.0000000000008,
   "height": 60.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    ParticleBufferManager / GPUParticlePool / MouseCursor → MainEngine。\n    所有者が初期化時に必要なものを渡せばよい。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    ParticleBufferManager / GPUParticlePool / MouseCursor → MainEngine。\n    所有者が初期化時に必要なものを渡せばよい。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 14468,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 64022,
   "updated": 1,
